{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-19 18:51:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, A LEADING LAW FIRM, ENCOURAGES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT AUGUST 29 DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - WFC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - AUGUST 19, 2022) - WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) BETWEEN FEBRUARY 24, 2021 AND JUNE 9, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT AUGUST 29, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-19 13:00:00', 'title': 'WFC INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD WELLS FARGO & COMPANY SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'BENSALEM, PA. , AUG. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-19 08:00:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO & COMPANY DECLARES CASH DIVIDENDS ON PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED DIVIDENDS ON EIGHT SERIES OF PREFERRED STOCK. A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $18.75 PER SHARE WAS DECLARED ON ITS 7.50% NONCUMULATIVE PERPETUAL CONVERTIBLE CLASS A PREFERRED STOCK, SERIES L, LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE $1,000 PER SHARE, WHICH IS TRADED ON THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE UNDER THE SYMBOL “WFCPRL”. THE SERIES L DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON SEPT. 15, 2022, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON AUG.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-08-19 05:45:00', 'title': 'WFC SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS WELLS FARGO SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF AUGUST 29, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , AUG. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/WFC-LAWSUIT-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=30969&FROM=4 THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF PERSONS AND ENTITIES THAT PURC